WEBVTT

00:54:59.527 --> 00:55:02.273
body-to-body and emotion-to-emotion.

00:55:02.297 --> 00:55:05.562
A surprisingly underappreciated sense
is our sense of smell.

00:55:05.586 --> 00:55:06.985
When we're around each other,

00:55:07.009 --> 00:55:10.235
we're constantly taking in each other's
pheromones and other things,

00:55:10.259 --> 00:55:12.903
and we're communicating
in a way we're not conscious of.

00:55:12.927 --> 00:55:15.674
And so, I would say people
in every neighborhood I go to,

00:55:15.698 --> 00:55:18.017
brunch has become the new church.

00:55:18.041 --> 00:55:21.841
People really need to be
in direct contact with each other,

00:55:21.865 --> 00:55:24.123
and they need to have local contacts.

00:55:24.147 --> 00:55:26.783
So, Netflix and all that stuff is great,

00:55:26.807 --> 00:55:29.457
but I don't think there's
anybody who really thinks

00:55:29.481 --> 00:55:33.259
that a fulfilling life is spent
watching "Game of Thrones."